  "data_abstract": "Event characterization in pp and p-Pb collisions thorough the measurement of the very forward energy detected by the ZDC. Energy detected in the neutron (ZN) and proton (ZP) zero-degree calorimeters are correlated to activity measured at midrapidity and in particular with: - multiplicity of charged particles produced in |eta|<1 - transverse momentum of particle with highest pt, pt leading, in |eta|<0.8.\n",
